      "19": {
        "attributes": {
          "font-size": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 19
          },
          "text": {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "TRANSPORT PLAY\nThis node is one in a suite of nodes that works with transport data. This node will output triggers based on what buttons are pressed in the transport panel. Press play to start the example.\n\n- Patch Explained -\n• The BPM is sent from the Transport Settings node to the divide node. Here it is divided by 500 and used as the frequency of the sine. Increase the BPM and the circle will pulse faster due to its higher frequency.\n• The Transport Play node sends out a trigger when the transport starts playing, is paused or is stopped. The triggers are converted to booleans by the Toggle node.\n• The boolean is either true or false. But we want the play trigger to always be false and the pause and stop triggers to always be true. For this we use a Switch. Regardless of the input, it will always output the same.\n• This boolean is used to bypass the Video Mixer. As a result pressing stop or pause will bypass the Video Mixer and we have no longer any output. Pressing Play will turn the bypass off again.\n"
          }
        },
        "bounds": {
          "height": 289.6644592285156,
          "width": 1088.5218505859375,
          "x": 508.16949462890625,
          "y": 91.77439880371094
        },
        "class": {
          "id": "77697265-3C1D-467D-A722-0FC566538374",
          "version": 0
        },
        "clock": "video",
        "constants": {},
        "hidden": [],
        "name": "Comment"
      },
      "21": {
        "attributes": {
          "font-size": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 19
          },
          "text": {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "OUTLETS\n\n• Play\nSends out a trigger when the play button is pressed.\n\n•  Pause\nSends out a trigger when the pause button is pressed.\n\n• Stop\nSends out a trigger when the stop button is pressed.\n\n\n"
          }
        },
        "bounds": {
          "height": 380,
          "width": 334,
          "x": 507.8954772949219,
          "y": 1029.951171875
        },
